{"seq":3,"slug":"uom-consistency-validation","title":"订单/库存/发票单位一致性校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-customs-rounding/uom-consistency-validation","wordCount":1784,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"订单-库存-发票单位一致性校验\">订单/库存/发票单位一致性校验</h1><p>前面十一篇建立的模型有一条共同的检验方式：把同一个量从四个不同入口换算回基准单位，看它们是否相等。订单行的销售单位数量、库存流水的基准单位数量、发票行的计价单位金额、报关单的法定单位数量——这四个数字由不同的服务写入、在不同的时点产生、用不同的单位表达，如果它们换算后仍然一致，那么整条链的单位处理就是对的。</p>\n<p>这篇讲怎么把这条检验做成可运行的工程对象，以及不一致时如何归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一致性校验的数学形式是一组<strong>分段等式</strong>，而不是一个全局等式。分段的原因在于链路上存在合理的业务差异：下单量与履约量之间隔着称重（可变重量），报关量与库存量之间隔着单位映射与取整。把合理的差异写成显式的参数（如履约比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>、报关容差），既让校验保持严格，又避免把正常业务误报为错误。</p>\n<p>校验的第二个关键设计是<strong>差异定位</strong>：等式有差异时，差值落在哪一段就排除了其他段的可能性。因此四入口不是两两比对，而是沿链路顺序分段比对——这让归因从&quot;哪里都可能错&quot;收敛到&quot;这一段错了&quot;，大幅缩短排查路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验的四个量\">校验的四个量</h2><h3 id=\"各自的口径\">各自的口径</h3><p>四个入口各有自己的权威字段，校验不能只看数字相等，还要看单位与换算依据是否匹配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>入口</th>\n<th>数量字段</th>\n<th>单位字段</th>\n<th>权威来源</th>\n<th>时点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单</td>\n<td>qty_sales</td>\n<td>qty_sales_uom</td>\n<td>客户下单</td>\n<td>下单时冻结</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存流水</td>\n<td>delta_base</td>\n<td>base_uom</td>\n<td>出入库事件</td>\n<td>事件发生时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发票</td>\n<td>qty_invoiced</td>\n<td>invoice_uom</td>\n<td>履约结果</td>\n<td>开票时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报关</td>\n<td>qty_statutory_1/2</td>\n<td>法定单位</td>\n<td>编码表规则</td>\n<td>申报时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个量之间<strong>不是简单的乘法关系</strong>：订单与发票之间隔着可变重量（实际称重可能不等于下单量），库存与报关之间隔着包装层级（报关按千克而库存可能是按件）。因此校验要按链路分段做，而不是一次性四者相等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分段等式的定义\">分段等式的定义</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext><mtext>inv</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext><mtext>order</mtext></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext><mtext>customs</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext><mtext>inv</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{base}}^{\\text{inv}} = q_{\\text{base}}^{\\text{order}} \\cdot \\eta, \\qquad q_{\\text{base}}^{\\text{customs}} = q_{\\text{base}}^{\\text{inv}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1275em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8805em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0906em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1275em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8805em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是履约比率：固定净含量商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；可变重量商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 等于实际称重与下单量之比（见 <a href=\"../uom-pricing-inventory/catch-weight-variable-weight\">按重量计价/可变重量商品</a>）。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 显式写出来，是为了让校验不把&quot;可变重量导致的正常差异&quot;误报成错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验的实现\">校验的实现</h2><h3 id=\"三段式校验\">三段式校验</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单行] --&gt; B{段1: 订单 vs 库存}&#10;  B --&gt;|固定净含量| B1[eta = 1]&#10;  B --&gt;|可变重量| B2[eta = 实称/下单]&#10;  B1 --&gt; C[换算到基准单位比对]&#10;  B2 --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|超出容差| X[归因: 单位错误/因子错误/数量错误]&#10;  C --&gt; D{段2: 库存 vs 发票}&#10;  D --&gt; E[基准单位比对&lt;br/&gt;单据间不应有差异]&#10;  E --&gt;|差异| Y[归因: 出库未开票/开票未出库]&#10;  E --&gt; F{段3: 发票 vs 报关}&#10;  F --&gt; G[按 customs_uom_mapping 换算]&#10;  G --&gt;|差异| Z[归因: 编码映射/重量口径 毛净重]&#10;  G --&gt; H[全部通过: 输出一致性报告]\">graph TD\n  A[订单行] --&gt; B{段1: 订单 vs 库存}\n  B --&gt;|固定净含量| B1[eta = 1]\n  B --&gt;|可变重量| B2[eta = 实称/下单]\n  B1 --&gt; C[换算到基准单位比对]\n  B2 --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|超出容差| X[归因: 单位错误/因子错误/数量错误]\n  C --&gt; D{段2: 库存 vs 发票}\n  D --&gt; E[基准单位比对&lt;br/&gt;单据间不应有差异]\n  E --&gt;|差异| Y[归因: 出库未开票/开票未出库]\n  E --&gt; F{段3: 发票 vs 报关}\n  F --&gt; G[按 customs_uom_mapping 换算]\n  G --&gt;|差异| Z[归因: 编码映射/重量口径 毛净重]\n  G --&gt; H[全部通过: 输出一致性报告]</pre><p>三段的容差不同：段 1 允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 带来的差异；段 2 应当零差异（同一批货的流出与开票必须一致）；段 3 允许取整差异但不允许口径差异（比如毛重净重混淆）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"校验查询\">校验查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH o AS (&#10;  SELECT ol.order_line_id, ol.sku_id, ol.qty_sales, ol.qty_sales_uom,&#10;         (ol.qty_sales * u.factor_to_base) AS q_base_order&#10;  FROM order_line ol&#10;  JOIN uom u ON u.uom_code = ol.qty_sales_uom&#10;  WHERE ol.created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;),&#10;l AS (&#10;  SELECT ref_id AS order_line_id, SUM(delta_base) AS q_base_ledger&#10;  FROM inventory_ledger&#10;  WHERE reason IN (&#39;SHIP&#39;,&#39;PICK&#39;) AND ref_type = &#39;ORDER_LINE&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY ref_id&#10;),&#10;i AS (&#10;  SELECT order_line_id, SUM(qty_invoiced * u.factor_to_base) AS q_base_invoice&#10;  FROM invoice_line il&#10;  JOIN uom u ON u.uom_code = il.invoice_uom&#10;  GROUP BY order_line_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT o.order_line_id, o.sku_id,&#10;       o.q_base_order,&#10;       l.q_base_ledger,&#10;       i.q_base_invoice,&#10;       ROUND(COALESCE(l.q_base_ledger,0) - o.q_base_order, 6) AS seg1_delta,&#10;       ROUND(COALESCE(i.q_base_invoice,0) - COALESCE(l.q_base_ledger,0), 6)&#10;         AS seg2_delta&#10;FROM o&#10;LEFT JOIN l ON l.order_line_id = o.order_line_id&#10;LEFT JOIN i ON i.order_line_id = o.order_line_id&#10;WHERE ABS(COALESCE(l.q_base_ledger,0) - o.q_base_order) &gt; 0.001&#10;   OR ABS(COALESCE(i.q_base_invoice,0) - COALESCE(l.q_base_ledger,0)) &gt; 0.001;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"