le=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"uom_masterdata_service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tolerances\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ORDER_TO_LEDGER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"relative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"absolute_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"LEDGER_TO_INVOICE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"relative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"absolute_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"INVOICE_TO_CUSTOMS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"absolute_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"eta_source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fulfillment_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_failure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CASE_QUEUE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"block_closure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>LEDGER_TO_INVOICE</code> 的相对容差为 0 是刻意的：同一批货的出库与开票在基准单位上必须精确相等，任何偏差都是流程缺陷。而 <code>ORDER_TO_LEDGER</code> 允许 2% 则是为可变重量预留的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不一致的归因顺序\">不一致的归因顺序</h2><h3 id=\"四类根因\">四类根因</h3><p>出现不一致时，按下面的顺序排查，可以避免在错误的方向上浪费时间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>检查点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>单位代码错误</td>\n<td>差异量级接近某个因子（如 2.2046 或 0.4536）</td>\n<td>订单/发票的单位字段是否被误填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>换算因子错误</td>\n<td>差异持续且方向一致，比例恒定</td>\n<td>是否出现两套因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>取整层错误</td>\n<td>差异微小且随数量线性增长</td>\n<td>中间层是否取过整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>数量本身错误</td>\n<td>差异随机、无比例关系</td>\n<td>出入库事件是否漏记/重记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第 1 项的判据特别有用：<strong>差异的比值接近某个已知换算因子</strong>，几乎总是单位字段填错，而不是数量算错。把这条判据写进归因逻辑，能自动化掉大部分工单。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个自动化的比值检测\">一个自动化的比值检测</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext><mtext>ledger</mtext></msubsup><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mtext>base</mtext><mtext>order</mtext></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{q_{\\text{base}}^{\\text{ledger}}}{q_{\\text{base}}^{\\text{order}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6805em;vertical-align:-1.0222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6913em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ledger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0222em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 落在已知因子（2.20462262、0.45359237、1000、0.001 等）附近，判定为单位错误。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT v.order_line_id, v.rho,&#10;  (SELECT k.uom_code FROM uom k&#10;    WHERE ABS(k.factor_to_base - v.rho) / v.rho &lt; 0.0001 LIMIT 1) AS likely_uom&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT o.order_line_id,&#10;         l.q_base_ledger / NULLIF(o.q_base_order, 0) AS rho&#10;  FROM o JOIN l USING (order_line_id)&#10;) v&#10;WHERE v.rho IS NOT NULL AND ABS(v.rho - 1) &gt; 0.02;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_line_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rho</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uom_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uom k</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">k</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factor_to_base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rho</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rho</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> likely_uom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_line_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">q_base_ledger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">q_base_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rho</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_line_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rho</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rho</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查出的 <code>likely_uom</code> 直接告诉操作员&quot;这次差异看起来像是把数量填成了 X 单位&quot;，把排查从人工试错变成一次查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验的执行时机\">校验的执行时机</h2><h3 id=\"三道闸口\">三道闸口</h3><p>一致性校验不应只在月末跑一次批处理，而应在三个时点分别执行，且<strong>阻断强度不同</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>阻断强度</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下单时</td>\n<td>单行</td>\n<td>阻断（订单不能提交）</td>\n<td>拦截单位不合法/跨族换算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出库时</td>\n<td>单批</td>\n<td>阻断（不能出库）</td>\n<td>拦截库存与订单的单位不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报前</td>\n<td>单票</td>\n<td>阻断（不能申报）</td>\n<td>拦截法定单位映射缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结账前</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>告警 + 工单</td>\n<td>发现历史累积的偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前三个闸口的共同特征是&quot;<strong>当场可修</strong>&quot;：操作员还在现场，可以补单位、补商品参数。结账前的全量校验则是兜底，因为此时修正成本已经很高——它的价值在于暴露系统性缺陷而不是修正单笔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四个入口（订单、库存、发票、报关）的单位表达必须能换算回同一个基准数量；校验按链路分段进行，因为段间存在合理的业务差异（如可变重量的履约比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>段 2（库存 vs 发票）容差为零；段 1 允许履约比率带来的差异；段 3 允许取整差异但不允许口径差异（毛净重）。</li>\n<li>归因按&quot;单位错误 → 因子错误 → 取整层错误 → 数量错误&quot;的顺序；差异比值接近已知因子时几乎必是单位填错，可自动化识别。</li>\n<li>校验应在下单、出库、申报三个时点就地阻断，结账前的全量校验用于发现系统性偏差。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>关于国际贸易中商品归类与法定计量单位的国际基础，见 <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx\">WCO 协调制度概述</a>；关税率分类与统计单位的国际口径见 <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/instrument-and-tools/hs-nomenclature-2022-edition.aspx\">WCO HS 2022 版</a>；货物完税价格的确定规则（数量与价格共同构成申报基础）见 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_info_e.htm\">WTO 海关估价协定</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"订单/库存/发票单位一致性校验","id":"订单-库存-发票单位一致性校验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"校验的四个量","id":"校验的四个量"},{"level":3,"text":"各自的口径","id":"各自的口径"},{"level":3,"text":"分段等式的定义","id":"分段等式的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"校验的实现","id":"校验的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"三段式校验","id":"三段式校验"},{"level":3,"text":"校验查询","id":"校验查询"},{"level":3,"text":"换算图的加载","id":"换算图的加载"},{"level":2,"text":"不一致的归因顺序","id":"不一致的归因顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"四类根因","id":"四类根因"},{"level":3,"text":"一个自动化的比值检测","id":"一个自动化的比值检测"},{"level":2,"text":"校验的执行时机","id":"校验的执行时机"},{"level":3,"text":"三道闸口","id":"三道闸口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"单位换算四舍五入与残差控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/unit-measure-packsize-conversion/uom-customs-rounding/uom-rounding-residual-control"},"next":null}